id: combat-wisdom-mark
name: Combat Wisdom
kind: conditions
maxStacks: 1
# Not a Combat Condition: what Combat Wisdom's (2) gives, for the Signature Technique it was declared with.
combatCondition: no
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Combat Wisdom: Wound Rolls and Might 1(T) higher for this Signature Technique.
text: >
  Combat Wisdom (2): If you use the Signature Technique Maneuver while benefiting from the effect of Insightful Warrior, increase your Wound Rolls and Might by 1(T) for the duration of that Maneuver.

---

[passive]
wound += 1(T);
might += 1(T);
